Changes
=======

v4.0.3 1 July 2026
  * Bump `github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4` to v4.1.0.

v4.0.2 7 May 2026
  * `jwk.Import` of an `*x448.PrivateKey` now verifies that the
    embedded public key matches the one derived from the seed,
    mirroring the existing check on `jwk.Export`. Defends against
    hand-assembled `*PrivateKey` values whose `pub` disagrees with
    the seed (reachable only via unsafe / cgo / wrappers),
    preventing such values from being imported into a JWK and
    observed via thumbprint or downstream consumers before the
    inconsistency would surface on the next export.

v4.0.1 28 Apr 2026
  * `validateECDHESAlg` now accepts any registered `ContentEncryption`
    algorithm (was previously hardcoded to a fixed subset).
  * Guard the X448 raw-key importers against nil typed pointers — they
    now return an error instead of dereferencing.

v4.0.0 19 Apr 2026
  * First stable v4 release. Tracks github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4 v4.0.0.

v4.0.0-alpha3 13 Apr 2026
  * Compatibility release for jwx/v4 v4.0.0-scratch.15. No code changes.

v4.0.0-alpha2 8 Apr 2026
  * Add DHKEM(X448, HKDF-SHA512) per RFC 9180 (dhkem sub-package).
  * Add HPKE Base mode implementation (hpke sub-package).
  * Register HPKE-5-KE (AES-256-GCM) and HPKE-6-KE (ChaCha20Poly1305) with jwx/v4.
  * Bump jwx/v4 to v4.0.0-scratch.5.

v4.0.0-alpha1 8 Apr 2026
  * Initial version: X448 ECDH-ES key agreement and JWK support for jwx/v4.
